{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Turn one repo's agent-commit on or off. The agent committer keeps its OWN registry at runtime/agent/commit-repos.json (agent-side; dev's repos.json stays owned by dev's writers). A repo listed here is agent-committed on the next sweep; a repo absent is left to dev.git's mechanical autocommit (or nothing). To migrate a repo from mechanical to agent commits: set_enabled(true) here AND dev.git.set_autocommit(false) - the sweep skips any repo still flagged in dev's registry and reports shadowed_by_dev_autocommit. Returns {repo, agent_commit}.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;","params":[{"name":"repo","type":"String"},{"name":"enabled","type":"Boolean"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"mvpptg1a1018f7572k1a79","readers":[],"time":1791027770617,"username":"system","writers":[]}